/04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:535:        - \\\"AC-4.4 access-revocation `redacted` branch\\\"\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:551:      - \\\"The live provenance API cannot emit `currentAttachmentVisibility: redacted`; access-loss cases currently collapse into `unavailable` because `buildSourceProvenanceEntry()` has no redacted branch.\\\"\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:567:      path: \\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility/007-verify.json\\\"\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:578:path: /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility/003-implementor.json\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:594:      storyId: \\\"04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility\\\"\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:597:      id: \\\"04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility\\\"\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-t