through AC-1.3 are covered in behavior by stripping shell ownership fields, preserving process-local current-material projection, and enabling referenced-artifact review entry without ownership transfer.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Validated the in-scope test-plan obligations with added server coverage for shell summary shape, current-material reverage; final verifier 013 reports no open findings.\\\"]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"story4-story-gate-format-failure\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Verifier 011 marked the formatting blocker resolved; final verifier 013 reports `green-verify` passed.\\\"]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"story4-story-gate-typecheck-failure\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Verifier 013 marked the typecheck fixture blocker resolved and reports `corepack pnpm run green-verify` passed.\\\"]}]},\\\"riskAndDeviationReview\\\":{\\\"specDeviations\\\":[],\\\"assumedRisks\\\":[],\\\"scopeChanges\\\":[],\\\"productionPathDecisionItems\\\":[]},\\\"diffReview\\\":{\\\"changedFiles\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/services/sources/source-provenance.service.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Added provenance recording and read-enrichment service for informed-work and received-code-update relationships.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/routes/source-management.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Added the authenticated process source-provenance GET route.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/app.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Wired the new source provenance service into Fastify and the environment service.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/environment/process-environment.service.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Recorded informed-work provenance after execution and received-code-update provenance after successful code checkpoints.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Extended store interfaces and implementations with durable source provenanc